86729030525_4296724039851930444_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=986d0uulCJQQ7kNvwHefWep&_nc_oc=AdoeiOz3JJNclnMMWzicoGLn-ouyt6dNwlsvMoZl-bIqasV7xGZe-FrUt4bFHYDZUTw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ-EWvBggkZju68ntmbsv5nNa0ebUEtXqa6ZKeoaolx-g&oe=6AE8B84A"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot_1771141017.png", "id": "1565774607979076", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499617850_1565774611312409_8889675988640395872_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TTHIM6t5swIQ7kNvwG6TvWw&_nc_oc=AdrDlM2BinCr00pgMnYiFl5Bk_PxURF5RSeCtRRLcK7cK6iPxWOAwytM_bc2yEwVn7Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQToLj_bZGsSMCXxgoLk8M2J5oht8BPDGDIFmwYNv7FuSA&oe=6AE89FE1"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "BeeJoy", "keywords": ["VRVideoPlayer", "3DVideoPlayer", "MVC3D", "SMB", "NAS"], "long_description": "BeeJoy is an advanced VR video player built for 3D movie enthusiasts, with support for MVC, SBS and OU playback, Blu-ray ISO/BDMV, NAS storage, and popular media servers.\n\n**Key Features**\n\n- **3D playback:** SBS, OU and MVC\n- **VR formats:** VR180 and VR360 video playback\n- **Blu-ray support:** Play ISO files and BDMV folders from local or network storage\n- **Network streaming:** SMB, WebDAV, FTP, SFTP and NFS\n- **Media servers:** Emby, Jellyfin, Plex and fnOS\n- **HDR video:** HDR and Dolby Vision on supported content and devices\n- **Immersive audio:** Dolby Atmos support\n- **Advanced controls:** Extensive video, audio, subtitle and playback options\n\nWhether you're watching standard videos, Blu-ray 3D movies, VR180/360 content, or media stored on your NAS, BeeJoy delivers a flexible and immersive viewing experience built for Meta Quest.\n\nMore features and improvements are continuously being added.", "short_description": "Advanced VR video player for 3D/MVC, Blu-ray ISO/BDMV, NAS and network streaming."}]}, "developer_name": null, "deve